<title>UK: Banque Indosuez to launch $200 mln FRN - dealers.</title>
<headline>Banque Indosuez to launch $200 mln FRN - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Indosuez will launch a subordinated structured $200 million FRN early next week, primary market players said on Friday. Dealers said Citibank International and Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International would lead manage the 10-year deal.</p>
<p>There will be a once only call after 2.5 years.</p>
<p>The notes were expected to pay LIBOR plus 30 basis points stepping up to 100 b.p. after five years. Banque Indosuez's subordinated debt is rated A1/A.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
